    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manasse yali agheza emyaka ikumi n'ebiri egy'obukulu ghe yafuukira kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, era yaafugira okumala entangama ya myaka amakumi ataanu n'etaanu mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakolanga ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda, ng'ajiira ku mpisa edheenhinhalwa edh'abamaghanga agandi Musengwa Katonda oyo be yabinga mu nsi eyo ng'Abaisiraeli bali kumpi okutuukayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba buyaaka ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, lata we Hezekia bye yali azikiriiza. Yaateeragho omusambwa Baali alutaari edh'okugusinzizaaku, era yaakola ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera. Yaasinzanga eby'oku igulu byonabyona era yaafuuka mugheereza waabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba alutaari mu isinzizo Musengwa Katonda lye yayogeraku ati: “Mu Yerusalemu mwe banansinzizanga lubeerera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaazimbira eby'oku igulu byonabyona alutaari mu mpya eibiri edh'eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaayokyanga batabane be ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, yaajanga mu balaguzi ni mu basamize, era yaakolanga eby'obulogo n'eby'emizimu. Yaakolanga inho ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda, yaamuleetera okusungughala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaata mu isinzizo ekifaananie eky'omusambwa omukazi Ashera kye yabaadha. Ate nga eisinzizo eryo, Musengwa Katonda lye yakoba Daudi ni mutabane we Solomoni ati: “Mu isinzizo lino eriri mu kibuga Yerusalemu kye nalondamu mu bibuga byonabyona eby'ebika bya Isiraeli, mwe banansinzizanga enaku dhoonadhoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era tiriirayo kutoola Baisiraeli mu nsi ye nagha badhaadha baibwe, ni mbaleetera kutambulatambula eyo batyo, kasita banaatangayo omwoyo okukola byonabyona bye nabalagira, n'okukuuma amateeka goonagoona n'ebiragiro bye nabagha nga mbita mu Musa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Manasse yaasendasenda abantu b'omu Buyudaaya n'ab'omu Yerusalemu, yaabaleetera okukola ebibi okusinga n'abantu abamaghanga agandi bye baakola, Musengwa Katonda be yazikiriza ng'Abaisiraeli bali kumpi okutuuka yo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaayogera ni Manasse n'abantu be, aye baaloba kufaayo naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Musengwa Katonda oyo yaaleeta abaduumizi b'eigye lya kyabazinga ow'e Assiria baalumba Buyudaaya, baagema Manasse n'ebyuma ebiri ng'oti malobo era baamusiba ku ndhegere edh'ekyuma ky'ekikomo, baamutwala e Babilonia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho bweyali ng'ali eyo mu kudaazibwadaazibwa, yeegayirira Musengwa Katonda we era yeewooya ekibitiriire mu maiso ga Katonda wa badhaadha be oyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaasaba Katonda, era Katonda oyo yaikiriza okwegayirira kwe, n'okusaba kwe yaakuwulirisa, yaamwiza e Yerusalemu ku bwakyabazinga bwe. Olwo Manasse yaamanha nga Musengwa Katonda ni Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nga biwoire, Manasse yaazimba ekimante eky'okuliya ku kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi ku luuyi lwa Gihoni olw'e buvandhuba mu kiiko, okutuuka aghaingirirwa mu gwetebwa Omulyango ogw'Ebyenhandha, n'okutuukira irala mu kitundu ekyetebwa Ofeli ekiri mu kibuga ekyo. Yaakizimba yaakituusa ghaigulu inho. Era yaata n'abaduumizi b'eigye mu bibuga ebindi ebyezungulwirwa ebimante ebigumu mu Buyudaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoola mu isinzizo bakatonda b'amaghanga agandi, n'ekisinzibwa ekitali Katonda kye yali atairemu, n'alutaari dhe yali azimbye ku lusozi olwazimbwaku eisinzizo eryo. Yaatoola ebintu ebyo ni mu bifo ebindi mu Yerusalemu, byonabyona yaabisuula kuliya kw'ekibuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba buyaaka alutaari ya Musengwa Katonda, era yaagheerayo ku alutaari eyo ebigheebwayo olw'okutabagana n'ebigheebwayo olw'okwebaza. Era yaalagira abantu b'omu Buyudaaya okusinzanga Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye waire ng'abantu baasigala nga bakaagheerayo emisengo mu bifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, emisengo egyo baagighangayo eri Musengwa Katonda waibwe yenka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebindi byonabyona Manasse bye yakola, ni bye yasaba Katonda we, n'ebyo abalanzi bye baayogeranga naye mu liina lya Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli, byaghandiikibwa mu Kitabo ky'Ebyomubyanda bya Bakyabazinga ba Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate ebigema ku ebyo Manasse bye yasaba Katonda, n'ebyo Katonda oyo bye yamwiramu olw'okusaba okwo, n'ebibi ghalala n'ebisobyo byonabyona bye yakola, n'ebifo ebigulumivu bye yazimba okusinzizangamu, n'ebifaananie eby'omusambwa omukazi Ashera bye yataagho, n'ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda bye yasinzanga ng'akaali kugonda kwenenia, byonabyona byaghandiikibwa mu Byafaayo eby'abalanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Manasse yaafa yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, era yaaziikibwa mu kisaagaati kye eky'obwakyabazinga. Mutabane we Amoni yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni yali agheza emyaka amakumi abiri n'ebiri egy'obukulu ghe yafuukira kyabazinga wa Buyudaaya, era yaafuga okumala entangama ya myaka ebiri mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni oyo yaakolanga ebibi eri Musengwa Katonda, nga lata we Manasse bye yakolanga. Yaaghangayo emisengo eri ebifaananie byonabyona ise bye yakola, era yaabisinzanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaloba kugonderanga Musengwa Katonda nga lata we Manasse bwe yakolanga, aye yeeyongeranga bweyongere kukola bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abakungu be baamukolera olukwe, baamutemulira mu kisaagaati kye eky'obwakyabazinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu b'omu Buyudaaya baita abo boonaboona abaakolera Amoni oyo olukwe, era baataagho mutabane we Yosia yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
